This is original, clean-room work. It contains no Sinclair, Amstrad or other
ROM code, and no ROM image; it needs the OpticOS ROM
(https://github.com/brixham99/OpticOS). "ZX Spectrum" and "Sinclair" are used
only to name the machine and belong to their respective owners.
